---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';
import {
  SD_LORA_BOUNDED_ACCELERATION_RESULT as result,
  SD_LORA_BOUNDED_ACCELERATION_SOURCE as source,
} from '../../data/sdLoraBoundedAccelerationStudy';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);
const root = '/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration/';
const sourceBase = `https://github.com/${source.repository}/blob/${source.commit}`;
const evidenceHref = `${sourceBase}/${source.trainingOrderPath}`;
const deviceHref = `${sourceBase}/${source.deviceSmokePath}`;
const muonHref = `${sourceBase}/${source.muonPath}`;
const flaHref = `${sourceBase}/${source.flaWyPath}`;
const planHref = `${sourceBase}/${source.planPath}`;
const boundedHref = p(`${root}sd-lora-bounded-state/`);
const scalingHref = p(`${root}sd-lora-scaling/`);
const pct = (value: number) => `${(value * 100).toFixed(1)}%`;
---
<article class="ba-accel" data-copy-review data-ui-audit data-sd-lora-bounded-acceleration>
  <header class="ba-accel__hero">
    <p class="ba-accel__context">{t('Bounded Online Recurrence · 后续加速研究', 'Bounded Online Recurrence · follow-up acceleration study')}</p>
    <h1>{t('Bounded 的主要时间花在训练', 'Most Bounded update time is spent in training')}</h1>
    <p class="ba-accel__lede">
      {t(
        `我们把 Bounded 的 rank128 压缩拆到四张 GPU，又试了 Muon / Newton–Schulz，也把 112 个小 SVD 一次批量计算。四卡结果可以逐 tensor 对上，但 warm 单卡压完 112 个 module 只要约 ${result.deviceSmoke.serialWarm112Seconds.toFixed(2)} 秒；真实 1.7B steady-state 的 10 个 AdamW step 要 ${result.steadyTraining.trainLoopSeconds.toFixed(2)} 秒，compression 只有 ${result.steadyTraining.compressionSeconds.toFixed(2)} 秒。`,
        `We sharded Bounded rank128 compression across four GPUs, tested Muon / Newton–Schulz, and also batched the 112 small SVDs into one call. The four-way result can match tensor-for-tensor, yet one warm GPU compresses all 112 modules in about ${result.deviceSmoke.serialWarm112Seconds.toFixed(2)} s; in a real 1.7B steady-state path, ten AdamW steps take ${result.steadyTraining.trainLoopSeconds.toFixed(2)} s while compression takes only ${result.steadyTraining.compressionSeconds.toFixed(2)} s.`,
      )}
    </p>
    <dl class="ba-accel__metrics" aria-label={t('决定研究方向的三个测量', 'Three measurements that changed the research direction')}>
      <div><dt>{t('steady-state 训练', 'Steady-state training')}</dt><dd>{result.steadyTraining.trainLoopSeconds.toFixed(2)} s</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('同轮 compression', 'Same-round compression')}</dt><dd>{result.steadyTraining.compressionSeconds.toFixed(2)} s</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('只换 AdamW 顺序', 'Reverse AdamW order')}</dt><dd>{result.orderDependence.changedModules}/{result.targetModules} {t('模块改变', 'modules changed')}</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="ba-accel__boundary">
      {t(
        '这些数字来自 GPU0–3 的工程小实验，不是正式 B2 / B3，也没有跑 WebShop formal rows 或 protected final panel。它们足以决定下一步工程注意力放哪里，但不能冒充正式效果实验。',
        'These numbers come from GPU0–3 engineering smokes, not formal B2 / B3. They consumed no formal WebShop rows and never opened the protected final panel. They are enough to redirect engineering attention, not to stand in for a formal efficacy experiment.',
      )}
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="ba-accel__section" aria-labelledby="shard-title">
    <h2 id="shard-title">{t('四张卡算得一模一样，但没有更快', 'Four GPUs matched exactly, but did not run faster')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      'Bounded 的 shared training 结束后，112 个 module 的 rank128 压缩可以彼此独立。我们先验证这件事，而不是直接假设“四卡一定更快”。GPU0 reference 对 GPU0/1/2/3 分片、以及 GPU3 reference 对镜像 GPU3/2/1/0，两次 assembly 都得到同一个 adapter SHA，所有 tensor 都逐元素相等。',
      'After Bounded shared training finishes, the 112 rank128 module-compression units are independent. We tested that fact before assuming four GPUs would be faster. GPU0 reference vs GPU0/1/2/3 shards, and GPU3 reference vs mirrored GPU3/2/1/0 shards, both assembled to the same adapter SHA with elementwise tensor equality.',
    )}</p>
    <div class="ba-accel__table-wrap">
      <table class="ba-accel__table">
        <thead><tr><th>{t('测法', 'Measurement')}</th><th>{t('结果', 'Result')}</th><th>{t('说明', 'Meaning')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">{t('两次物理映射', 'Two physical mappings')}</th>
            <td><strong>{t('byte / tensor exact', 'byte / tensor exact')}</strong></td>
            <td>{t('GPU 编号没有改变 compression 的结果', 'Physical GPU identity did not change the compression result')}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">{t('单 GPU warm · 112 modules', 'One warm GPU · 112 modules')}</th>
            <td>{result.deviceSmoke.singleGpuWarm112Seconds.toFixed(3)} s</td>
            <td>{t('整个 suffix 已经是亚秒级', 'The whole suffix is already sub-second')}</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">{t('四个 cold 容器', 'Four cold containers')}</th>
            <td>{result.deviceSmoke.fourColdContainerSeconds[0].toFixed(2)}–{result.deviceSmoke.fourColdContainerSeconds[1].toFixed(2)} s</td>
            <td>{t('启动 Python / CUDA / Docker 的成本盖过了并行收益', 'Python / CUDA / Docker startup overwhelms the parallel work')}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>{t(
      '把每个 shard 的输入从完整 prior 预切成自己的 28 个 module 以后，四卡仍没有变快；换成单容器四 GPU 也只把冷启动缩短了一部分。问题不在“205 MB 输入读了四遍”这一件事上。',
      'Pre-splitting each shard down to its own 28 modules did not make the four-way path faster, and one multi-GPU container only removed part of the cold-start cost. Re-reading the full 205 MB prior was not the main explanation.',
    )}</p>
  </section>
  <section class="ba-accel__section" aria-labelledby="svd-title">
    <h2 id="svd-title">{t('Muon 给了方向感，但 SVD 不是主瓶颈', 'Muon suggested a direction, but SVD is not the main bottleneck')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      `steady-state Bounded 会把 rank${result.stateRank} prior 和 rank${result.currentRank} current 合成一个 ${result.spectralCore}×${result.spectralCore} 的小 core，再通过 SVD 保留最大的 rank${result.stateRank} 方向。我们想到 Muon，是因为它用少量 Newton–Schulz 迭代把昂贵的谱运算改写成 GPU 擅长的矩阵乘。`,
      `Steady-state Bounded combines a rank${result.stateRank} prior and rank${result.currentRank} current update into a small ${result.spectralCore}×${result.spectralCore} core, then uses SVD to keep the largest rank${result.stateRank} directions. Muon was relevant because it replaces a spectral operation with a few GPU-friendly Newton–Schulz matrix iterations.`,
    )}</p>
    <p>{t(
      `但 Muon 原始默认的 ${result.muonNs.originalMuonDefaultSteps} 次 Newton–Schulz 主要近似 orthogonalization / polar factor，不会自动选择 top-${result.stateRank} singular directions。我们把迭代跑到 ${result.muonNs.comparisonSteps[1]} 次，结果仍是 rank${result.muonNs.nsRankAfter12}；被 Bounded 真正丢掉的 8 个方向没有变成 0。`,
      `But Muon's original ${result.muonNs.originalMuonDefaultSteps}-step Newton–Schulz primarily approximates orthogonalization / a polar-like factor; it does not select the top-${result.stateRank} singular directions. Even at ${result.muonNs.comparisonSteps[1]} steps the witness remained rank${result.muonNs.nsRankAfter12}; the eight directions Bounded must actually discard did not become zero.`,
    )}</p>
    <figure class="ba-accel__equation" aria-label={t('rank128 prior 和 rank8 current 形成 136 维 core，再截断回 rank128', 'rank128 prior and rank8 current form a 136-dimensional core, then truncate back to rank128')}>
      <span>rank128 prior</span><b>+</b><span>rank8 current</span><b>→</b><span>136 × 136 core</span><b>→</b><span>top-128 SVD</span>
    </figure>
    <div class="ba-accel__table-wrap">
      <table class="ba-accel__table ba-accel__table--numbers">
        <thead><tr><th>{t('GPU0 warm 路径', 'GPU0 warm path')}</th><th>{t('时间', 'Time')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('原始 serial compression · 112 modules', 'Original serial compression · 112 modules')}</th><td>{result.batchedSvd.serialWarm112Seconds.toFixed(3)} s</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('batched QR / core 构造', 'Batched QR / core construction')}</th><td>{result.batchedSvd.qrCoreBuildSeconds.toFixed(3)} s</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">112 × 136 × 136 batched SVD</th><td>{result.batchedSvd.svd112x136x136Seconds.toFixed(3)} s</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('重建并拷回 CPU', 'Reconstruction and CPU copy')}</th><td>{result.batchedSvd.reconstructSeconds.toFixed(3)} s</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('batched exact 总计', 'Batched exact total')}</th><td><strong>{result.batchedSvd.totalSeconds.toFixed(3)} s</strong></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>{t(
      `batched 版本最后所有 tensor 仍然 exact，最大绝对差是 ${result.batchedSvd.maxAbsDifference}；但总时间 ${result.batchedSvd.totalSeconds.toFixed(3)} 秒，没有打败原来的 ${result.batchedSvd.serialWarm112Seconds.toFixed(3)} 秒。真正的 batched SVD 本身只有 ${result.batchedSvd.svd112x136x136Seconds.toFixed(3)} 秒。继续把主要精力放在 SVD、Muon 或 Polar 类近似上，解决不了这条训练路径的大头。`,
      `The batched version stayed tensor-exact with max absolute difference ${result.batchedSvd.maxAbsDifference}, but its ${result.batchedSvd.totalSeconds.toFixed(3)} s total did not beat the original ${result.batchedSvd.serialWarm112Seconds.toFixed(3)} s. The batched SVD itself took only ${result.batchedSvd.svd112x136x136Seconds.toFixed(3)} s. Spending the main effort on SVD, Muon, or polar-like approximations would not attack the dominant training cost.`,
    )}</p>
  </section>
  <section class="ba-accel__section" aria-labelledby="training-title">
    <h2 id="training-title">{t('真实 1.7B 路径里，时间花在训练', 'On the real 1.7B path, time goes into training')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '前面的 compression smoke 只回答了后处理有多重。为了确认真正一轮 Bounded 更新把时间花在哪里，我们又用冻结的 Qwen3-1.7B、同一 dataset、seed 1993、AdamW 和原来的 rank8 → rank128 路径跑了两次小训练。',
      'The compression smokes only measured the suffix. To see where a real Bounded update spends time, we ran two small training smokes with the frozen Qwen3-1.7B model, the same dataset, seed 1993, AdamW, and the original rank8 → rank128 path.',
    )}</p>
    <div class="ba-accel__table-wrap">
      <table class="ba-accel__table ba-accel__table--numbers">
        <thead><tr><th>{t('路径', 'Path')}</th><th>{t('model load', 'model load')}</th><th>{t('训练', 'training')}</th><th>compression</th><th>{t('engine 总计', 'engine total')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">{t('Round0 · 5 current · 5 steps', 'Round0 · 5 current · 5 steps')}</th>
            <td>{result.round0Training.modelLoadSeconds.toFixed(2)} s</td><td>{result.round0Training.trainLoopSeconds.toFixed(2)} s</td><td>{result.round0Training.compressionSeconds.toFixed(2)} s</td><td>{result.round0Training.engineTotalSeconds.toFixed(2)} s</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">{t('steady-state · 5 current + 5 replay · 10 steps', 'steady state · 5 current + 5 replay · 10 steps')}</th>
            <td>{result.steadyTraining.modelLoadSeconds.toFixed(2)} s</td><td><strong>{result.steadyTraining.trainLoopSeconds.toFixed(2)} s</strong></td><td>{result.steadyTraining.compressionSeconds.toFixed(2)} s</td><td>{result.steadyTraining.engineTotalSeconds.toFixed(2)} s</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p class="ba-accel__result-line">{t(
      `steady-state 的训练 loop 是 compression 的 ${result.steadyTraining.trainToCompressionRatio.toFixed(1)}×；compression 只占 engine 时间的 ${pct(result.steadyTraining.compressionFractionOfEngineTotal)}。`,
      `The steady-state training loop is ${result.steadyTraining.trainToCompressionRatio.toFixed(1)}× the compression time; compression is only ${pct(result.steadyTraining.compressionFractionOfEngineTotal)} of engine time.`,
    )}</p>
    <p>{t(
      '这一步改变了研究方向：Bounded 已经把“历史越长、component 越多”的旧问题压掉了，但下一层顺序瓶颈仍然在 full-model forward / backward、global gradient clipping、AdamW moments 和 learned coefficient 的更新轨迹里。',
      'This changed the research direction. Bounded removed the old cost of carrying an ever-growing component history, but the remaining sequential bottleneck sits in full-model forward / backward, global gradient clipping, AdamW moments, and the learned-coefficient trajectory.',
    )}</p>
  </section>
  <section class="ba-accel__section" aria-labelledby="order-title">
    <h2 id="order-title">{t('同样五个训练样本，只把顺序倒过来，模型就变了', 'The same five training examples produce a different model when their order is reversed')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '如果 AdamW 的这些 step 可以像普通矩阵块一样独立计算，再把 chunk 合起来，那么仅仅交换执行顺序不应该把最终函数改得这么大。我们因此做了一个最小反例：dataset、五个 training example 对象、seed、模型初始化、AdamW、学习率、replay 和 compression 全部不变，只把 optimizer loop 的遍历顺序从 1→2→3→4→5 改成 5→4→3→2→1。',
      'If these AdamW steps could be computed as independent matrix chunks and merged later, merely reversing their execution order should not change the final function this much. We therefore ran a minimal counterexample: dataset, the five training-example objects, seed, model initialization, AdamW, learning rates, replay, and compression stayed fixed; only the optimizer traversal changed from 1→2→3→4→5 to 5→4→3→2→1.',
    )}</p>
    <figure class="ba-accel__order" aria-label={t('同样五个训练样本的正序和反序 AdamW 轨迹', 'Forward and reversed AdamW trajectories over the same five training examples')}>
      <div><strong>{t('原顺序', 'Original order')}</strong><span>1 → 2 → 3 → 4 → 5</span></div>
      <div><strong>{t('只改顺序', 'Order only')}</strong><span>5 → 4 → 3 → 2 → 1</span></div>
    </figure>
    <dl class="ba-accel__findings">
      <div><dt>{t('有效更新改变', 'Effective updates changed')}</dt><dd><strong>{result.orderDependence.changedModules}/{result.targetModules}</strong> modules</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('整体 dense update 差异', 'Aggregate dense-update difference')}</dt><dd><strong>{(result.orderDependence.aggregateDenseRelativeL2Difference * 100).toFixed(2)}%</strong> relative L2</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('learned coefficient', 'Learned coefficient')}</dt><dd>{result.orderDependence.originalCurrentCoefficient.toFixed(6)} → {result.orderDependence.reversedCurrentCoefficient.toFixed(6)}</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p>{t(
      '我们没有停在 adapter 文件 SHA 不同，因为低秩因子和 SVD 可能存在等价表示。进一步比较每个 module 真正作用到权重上的 dense update B·A 后，112 个 module 全部不同；整体相对 L2 差约 59.36%。这说明有效权重更新本身变了，不只是低秩因子的表示或序列化。',
      'We did not stop at different adapter file hashes because low-rank factors and SVD may admit equivalent representations. Comparing the effective dense update B·A for every module showed that all 112 modules changed; the aggregate relative L2 difference was about 59.36%. The effective weight update itself changed, not merely the low-rank representation or serialization.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="ba-accel__boundary ba-accel__boundary--inline">{t(
      '这项反例排除了“把现有 AdamW step 独立分块、重排后再 merge”这种朴素 A。它没有证明所有可能的 exact chunk transfer 都不存在；如果 exact A 存在，它必须保留完整的状态依赖。',
      'This counterexample rules out naive A that independently chunks or reorders the existing AdamW steps and merges them later. It does not prove that every possible exact chunk transfer is impossible; any exact A would have to preserve the full state dependence.',
    )}</p>
  </section>
  <section class="ba-accel__section" aria-labelledby="fla-title">
    <h2 id="fla-title">{t('FLA / WY 真正提醒我们：先证明状态可以组合', 'The real FLA / WY lesson: prove the state transition composes first')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      'DeltaNet 的 chunkwise 做法成立，是因为它的 hidden-state recurrence 可以写成 generalized Householder transformations，再用 compact WY / UT 把一段顺序更新表示成可组合的矩阵对象。关键不是“WY 很快”，而是它先有一个可以 exact composition 的递推结构。',
      'DeltaNet chunkwise execution works because its hidden-state recurrence can be written as generalized Householder transformations, then represented with compact WY / UT as composable matrix objects. The key is not simply that WY is fast; the recurrence first admits exact composition.',
    )}</p>
    <div class="ba-accel__table-wrap">
      <table class="ba-accel__table">
        <thead><tr><th>{t('对象', 'Object')}</th><th>{t('能否直接 composition', 'Directly composable?')}</th><th>{t('原因', 'Why')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><th scope="row">DeltaNet / FLA</th><td><strong>{t('可以', 'Yes')}</strong></td><td>{t('recurrence 能改写成可组合的 Householder / WY 表示', 'the recurrence admits a composable Householder / WY representation')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('去掉训练与压缩的简化 Bounded', 'Simplified Bounded without training/compression')}</th><td><strong>{t('可以', 'Yes')}</strong></td><td><code>M′ = aM + B</code> {t('本身就是 affine transfer', 'is already an affine transfer')}</td></tr>
          <tr><th scope="row">{t('现在的真实 Bounded', 'Current real Bounded')}</th><td><strong>{t('还没有', 'Not yet')}</strong></td><td>{t('下一步 gradient、AdamW moments、global clip、coefficient 和 GDR write 都依赖 incoming state', 'the next gradient, AdamW moments, global clipping, coefficient, and GDR write all depend on the incoming state')}</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>{t(
      '因此 exact A 的研究问题不是“怎样把 SVD 再切一刀”，而是能不能找到一个 chunk object，把模型/LoRA 状态、AdamW 一二阶 moments、learned coefficient、global clipping / order 依赖、compression boundary，以及 GDR 开启时的 write-control 一起概括，并且按原顺序 exact composition。',
      'So the exact-A question is not how to split SVD one more time. It is whether a chunk object can summarize the model/LoRA state, AdamW first and second moments, learned coefficient, global-clipping/order dependence, compression boundary, and the GDR write-control state when enabled, then compose exactly in the original order.',
    )}</p>
    <p class="ba-accel__formula"><code>T_chunk(full state in) → full state out</code></p>
    <p>{t(
      '如果找不到这样的 transfer，A 就不能再叫“原 Bounded 的纯工程加速”。那时可以继续研究 parallel / approximate optimizer，但必须给它新的 method identity，再做前瞻性的科学资格实验。',
      'If no such transfer exists, A can no longer be called a pure engineering acceleration of the original Bounded method. A parallel or approximate optimizer may still be worth studying, but it needs a new method identity and prospective scientific qualification.',
    )}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="ba-accel__section" aria-labelledby="decision-title">
    <h2 id="decision-title">{t('现在的研究路线已经收窄', 'The research path is now much narrower')}</h2>
    <div class="ba-accel__decision-list">
      <div><strong>{t('B · 四卡 compression suffix', 'B · four-GPU compression suffix')}</strong><p>{t('正确性有希望：GPU0–3 两种物理映射都 exact。性能上当前是负收益；正式 GPU4–7 B2/B3 仍未关闭。', 'Correctness looks promising: two GPU0–3 physical mappings were exact. Performance is currently negative; formal GPU4–7 B2/B3 remain open.')}</p></div>
      <div><strong>{t('Muon / SVD 优化', 'Muon / SVD optimization')}</strong><p>{t('降级。Muon 不是 truncated-SVD drop-in replacement，exact batched SVD 也没有打败原 serial suffix。', 'Deprioritized. Muon is not a truncated-SVD drop-in replacement, and exact batched SVD did not beat the original serial suffix.')}</p></div>
      <div><strong>{t('naive A · 独立 chunk AdamW step', 'Naive A · independent AdamW-step chunks')}</strong><p>{t('排除为纯工程 successor。只改五个 step 的顺序，112/112 个 module 的有效更新都改变。', 'Ruled out as a pure engineering successor. Reordering only five steps changed the effective update in all 112 modules.')}</p></div>
      <div><strong>{t('exact A · full-state transfer', 'Exact A · full-state transfer')}</strong><p>{t('仍然开放。只有推导出能保留完整 optimizer / model state 依赖并可 exact composition 的 transfer，才继续叫工程等价加速。', 'Still open. It remains an engineering-equivalent acceleration only if a transfer can preserve the full optimizer/model-state dependence and compose exactly.')}</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="ba-accel__boundary ba-accel__boundary--inline">{t(
      '这里没有把 GPU0–3 smoke 升级成正式 B2/B3，也没有宣布“所有 exact A 都不可能”。当前最合理的下一步是 A0/A1 数学推导；如果必须改变 optimizer 语义才能并行，再单独决定是否开一个新的科学方法。',
      'Nothing here upgrades the GPU0–3 smokes into formal B2/B3, and nothing claims that every exact A is impossible. The next step is the A0/A1 derivation; if parallelism requires changing optimizer semantics, that becomes a separate decision about a new scientific method.',
    )}</p>
    <nav class="ba-accel__next" aria-label={t('相关研究', 'Related research')}>
      <a href={boundedHref}>{t('回看 Bounded Online Recurrence 的封存结果', 'Review the sealed Bounded Online Recurrence result')}</a>
      <a href={scalingHref}>{t('回看 Vanilla SD-LoRA 为什么随历史越来越慢', 'Review why Vanilla SD-LoRA slows as history grows')}</a>
    </nav>
  </section>
  <details class="ba-accel__evidence">
    <summary>{t('证据与复现边界', 'Evidence and reproduction boundary')}</summary>
    <div class="ba-accel__evidence-grid">
      <div><strong>{t('四卡 compression smoke', 'Four-GPU compression smoke')}</strong><p>{t('GPU0–3 两种物理映射、冷/热启动、single-container 与 batched-SVD 数据。', 'GPU0–3 two physical mappings, cold/warm startup, single-container, and batched-SVD measurements.')}</p><a href={deviceHref}><ExternalBrandMark href={deviceHref} />{t('打开公开证据', 'Open public evidence')}</a></div>
